   "description": "Annual since 1989 (Queen Anne Press/Macdonald, then Headline, Dorling Kindersley, and Hamlyn from 2006). Russell Ash compiled every edition up to 2011 (published Sept 2010, after his death). Continuation editions are not counted here: 2012 credited to Caroline and Alexander Ash, 2013 to Caroline Ash, 2014-2019 to Paul Terry (Wikipedia; Hachette). Reported translation languages: Czech, Danish, Dutch, Estonian, Finnish, French, German, Greek, Gujarati, Hungarian, Icelandic, Japanese, Norwegian, Polish, Slovak, Swedish (Wikipedia; edition-level records found so far only for French and German)",
